c\\\")\"\necho \"  from training_pipeline import train_model\"\necho \"  train_model()\"\necho \"  '\"\necho \"\"\necho \"For more information:\"\necho \"  - README_PRODUCTION.md - Complete guide\"\necho \"  - IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md - What was implemented\"\necho \"\"\necho \"╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\"\necho \"║                  Setup Complete! Ready to train.               ║\"\necho \"╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\"\n